    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mermaid's Paradoxical Tale:</h2></h2></h2>Submerge into the mystical world beneath the waves and above the land in Mermaid's Paradoxical Tale, a breathtaking 3D exploration and puzzle-solving adventure. As a graceful mermaid, you are the last beacon of hope for a marine realm threatened by enigmatic dark monsters. Dive deep and unravel the mysteries that lurk in the shadows, stretching from sunlit shores to the darkest oceanic abyss.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/e0307caef6a1840db62a0c6fe89682ad.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=348 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/e0307caef6a1840db62a0c6fe89682ad.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/e0307caef6a1840db62a0c6fe89682ad.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive 3D Environments:</h2> Swim through vibrant underwater ecosystems, explore sun-kissed islands, delve into eerie underwater caves, and venture into the unknown depths where darkness reigns. The world of Mermaid's Paradoxical Tale is teeming with life and cloaked in mysteries waiting to be discovered, both beneath the waves and on the tranquil islands that dot the horizon.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5d97dc0ae8d6cc88a3b1be849dbb01b1.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=280 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5d97dc0ae8d6cc88a3b1be849dbb01b1.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5d97dc0ae8d6cc88a3b1be849dbb01b1.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing Puzzles:</h2> As you venture through the realm, you'll come across intricate challenges and puzzles. Use your mermaid abilities, intellect, and the environment itself to unlock secrets and pave your way forward.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/26de556b18d0a2c6a08768cdbb9e1a6e.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=296 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/26de556b18d0a2c6a08768cdbb9e1a6e.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/26de556b18d0a2c6a08768cdbb9e1a6e.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tale of Curiosity and Shadows:</h2> Embark on a journey with a curious mermaid who, upon discovering an ancient ruin, finds herself entwined in a larger narrative. As she delves deeper into underwater caves solving enigmatic puzzles, she stumbles upon dark creatures whose origins are shrouded in mystery. Unravel an unfolding story through the remnants of a forgotten past and decoding the whispers of the abyss.                                                            <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/60bbd95e27a4dd079b709b0e20930a5a.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=334 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/60bbd95e27a4dd079b709b0e20930a5a.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/60bbd95e27a4dd079b709b0e20930a5a.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Gameplay:</h2> Traverse through the captivating underwater realms and the mysterious islands solving puzzles that pave the way to hidden realms. Encounter dark creatures in the heart of the abyss, evoking a thrilling blend of excitement and intrigue in a world brimming with wonder.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/20f6ad30011dd1c69145722ea94b1187.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/20f6ad30011dd1c69145722ea94b1187.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/20f6ad30011dd1c69145722ea94b1187.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5900c80b84d3045d0a599403d4f4e2d0.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=326 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5900c80b84d3045d0a599403d4f4e2d0.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/5900c80b84d3045d0a599403d4f4e2d0.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into Discovery:</h2> Embark on a journey of exploration with our adventurous mermaid as she uncovers the mysteries of ancient ruins and underwater caves. While not every ripple holds a tale, the islands and caverns she explores hide puzzles waiting to be solved. As you delve into the unknown, will you unravel the secrets that lie beneath the waves and shadows? Dive into the Mermaid's Paradoxical Tale and engage in a story ripe with intrigue and discovery.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/f062d1ee37790594f25e02eee5e4d8c7.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=448 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/f062d1ee37790594f25e02eee5e4d8c7.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/f062d1ee37790594f25e02eee5e4d8c7.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/6c93a1c7cecd50564ae12d1754233fd8.poster.avif?t=1703189317\" width=396 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/6c93a1c7cecd50564ae12d1754233fd8.webm?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639700/extras/6c93a1c7cecd50564ae12d1754233fd8.mp4?t=1703189317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Transitions:</h2> Switch effortlessly between first-person and third-person perspectives to get the best vantage point for your journey and to solve intricate puzzles.",
